WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
From need to award.

00:02.000 --> 00:07.000
Departments define the items, quantities, specifications, and target delivery date.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
The sourcing team turns approved requests into tenders with clear deadlines.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Invited suppliers review the requirements, then submit their offers and documents.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Reviewers check compliance and compare offers against technical and financial requirements.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
The manager reviews the recommendation, with top committee approval when required.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Finally, the award is recorded, the tender closes, and participants are notified.
